<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est 95,000, Wk ago: 103,000, and Yr ago: 98,000. Saturday's 25,000, 21,000, and 34,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
